","Gary Cole","Amy Sedaris","Don Cheadle","Kellan Lutz","Frosty Lawson","Fred Melamed","Robert Carlock","John Hodgman","Andrea Martin","Rebecca Mader","Octavia Spencer","Tim Meadows","Josh Flitter","Zack Robidas","Chris Kerson","Sondra James","Bernie McInerney","Wayne Scott Miller","Reathel Bean","Matt Oberg","Helen Coxe","Judy Gold","Alice Kremelberg","Dena Tyler","Miles J. Harvey","Matt Hubbard","Christine Toy Johnson","Storm Garner","Raven Goodwin","Jimmy Palumbo","Tanner Flood","Jeff Hiller","Josh Casaubon","James St. Vincent","Tom Patrick Stephens","Bob Wiltfong","Victor Cruz","Michael Devine","Helene Taylor","Catia Ojeda","Jamie Choi","Bridget Moloney","Alison White","Dante Hoagland","Tijuana Ricks","opice Katie","Nicol Paone","Brendan Walsh","Michael Mulheren","Jaret Martino","Adriana DeMeo","Justiin A. Davis","Teddy Coluca","Phil Rosenthal","Michael Benjamin Washington","Ann Harada","Maryam Basir","Mitch Poulos","Tracey Wigfield","Mary Catherine Garrison","Ira Glass","Devin Dunne Cannon","Kelly Deadmon","Alok Tewari","Nick Bernardone","Krista Dane Hoffman","Andrew Law","Miguel Pinzon","Christopher Nicholas Smith","Mark Doherty","Frank Ridley","Chris Barnes","Robert Randolph","Marti Gould Cummings","Aalok Mehta","Jennifer Bassey","Pat Kiernan","Mandy Fabian","Sándor Técsy","Talib Kweli","Ana Maria Jomolca","Ariel Shafir","Marguerite Stimpson","Sunita Deshpande","Grant Lancaster","Ano Okera","Mike Clemente","Andre Ward","John DeLuca","Drew Gehling","Ben Cook","Dave Finkel","Seth Kirschner","Rock Kohli","Rita Gardner","Kresh Novakovic","Brett Baer","Elizabeth Taufield","Johnnie Mae","Peter Linz","Savannah Guthrie","Harlin C. Kearsley","Jill Abramovitz","Jeff Blumenkrantz","Michael McDonald","Jon Shaver","Lacretta","Patrick Noonan","Marlon Saunders","Tyler Merna","Mike Harvey","Kevin Yamada","Arnold Y. Kim","Griffin Richardson","Nicole Drespel","Gayle King","Nedra Marie Taylor","Emalee Burditt","Peter Jessop","Lori Hammel","Lisette Oropesa","Guy Bayo","Joanna Bradley","Melissa McMeekin","Teresa Yenque","Gerrianne Raphael","Stuart Zagnit","Richard F. Esposito","Randi Bailyn","Chris Hansen","Bill Kurtis","Sarah Schenkkan","Jun Naito","Noel MacNeal","Chen Tang","Brian Stack","Angela Grovey","Cornel West","Stewart Brodian","Johanna Telander","Tori Feinstein","Michael Schwartz","James Downey","Matty Blake","Devin Richards","Meredith Vieira"],"screenwriters":["Robert Carlock","Kay Cannon","Nina Pedrad","Colleen McGuinness","Daisy Gardner","Hannibal Buress","Ron Weiner","John Riggi","Luke Del Tredici","Donald Glover","Paula Pell","Tina Fey","Jon Pollack","Vali Chandrasekaran","Jack Burditt","Andrew Guest","Jon Haller","Tami Sagher","Matt Hubbard","Lauren Gurganous","Sam Means","Lang Fisher","Tracey Wigfield","Dave Finkel","Brett Baer","Steve Hely"],"cinematographers":["Vanja Cernjul","Michael Slovis","Peter Reniers","Matthew Clark","Tom Houghton","Michael Trim","William Klayer"],"composers":["Jeff Richmond","Giancarlo Vulcano"],"reviews":[{"author":"McClane","text":"hodnocení po první sérii: 30 Rock není prvpolánovitej útok na bránice, jakej bych čekal od jednoho z nejúspěšnejších sitcomů posledních let. Záchvaty smíchu se nekonaj, leckdy ani normální smích, ale je tu jeden velkej důvod proč koukat, a to je Liz Lemon v podání Tiny Fey. Tu si nejde nezamilovat, ani když si vyndavá salát z vlasů a hlavně: pozná rozdíl mezi Star Trekem a Star Wars. Přesto to nebude hodně lidem stačit, navíc kdybych neviděl x dílů za sebou, bavil bych se asi ještě míň. 70%.(29.01.2010)","stars":4},{"author":"Carlossss","text":"...tak jako jsem po skončení Six Feet Under chtěl jít z fleku dělat pohřebáka a po dokoukání Scrubs doktora, přemáhá mě teď nutkání na všechno se vykašlat a jít dělat scénáristu. Teda pouze za předpokladu, že mi vedení bude dělat Liz Lemon s Jackem Donaghy a moje skeče bude obstarávat Tracy Jordan. Seriál téměř bez chyby.. Je jenom škoda(a za to jdu s hvězdičkou dolů), že ke konci seriálu hodně dochází dech a jde to vidět třeba na tom, že postupně se vrací snad všechny vedlejší postavy a cameo role.. bez žádnýho vedlejšího smyslu.. prostě jenom proto, že poprvý měly docela úspěch.(24.03.2013)","stars":4},{"author":"Looser","text":"Po prvních dvou dílech žádné nadšení, spíš takové koukání na obrázky. Tina Fey je sice sympatická, ale takový tahoun a bavič aby utáhla celou show ...nevim, nevim. Krakowski mi nesedí už od Ally McBeal a rádoby vtipný a cool ulítlej černoch je spíš trapnej. A tak to celé zachraňuje hlavní chlouba seriálu Alec Baldwin. Seriál mně vlastně pobavil jenom díky vtipným narážkám na americké kulturu a společnosti (GE a spol.), ale to je u mně na 4 hvězdy málo. Uvidíme co dál, jestli si pustím další díl.(24.09.2007)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.54a9f79f-a9c0-c95b-7965-5733d9e3ef74"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/225741-studio-30-rock/prehled/","root_id":225741,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":7,"episode_count":138,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[{"season_no":5,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":null,"title":"Reaganing (S05E05)","platforms":["Prime Video"]},{"season_no":6,"episode_no":18,"vod_date":null,"title":"Murphy Brown Lied to Us (S06E18)","platforms":["Prime Video"]}]}